{ type: install
  message: <<EOM

Don't forget to uncomment the LoadModule line in your httpd.conf:
LoadModule evasive_module     libexec/apache24/mod_evasive.so

If you had the old ap24-mod_evasive installed and are installing this one,
note that in this version to get mod_evasive enabled, you must include
the directive below in your mod_evasive.conf:

DOSEnabled	true

EOM
}
